  "sevenFamilyAdmission": {
    "verdict": "Verified performance parity was not established across the fixed seven families against both controls; the draft stack remains held.",
    "reference": "/Volumes/Depot/Developer/glyph/.cache/held-rerun-20261019/evidence/boundary-wave-20261022/fixed20-admission-review.md",
    "referenceSha256": "f260c8c104908e6e556e02409f0174509e6094be1f7b22d890d2860913f3b454",
    "summary": "Dense 512 and 1024, long unsafe-boundary reflow, cold mounting, width-change measurement, and small repeated setter have complete-operation median losses. Sparse publication, independent copy/inspection, prepared inspection, sparse borrow, and repeated edit/read sequences retain gains. Gains and aggregate Labs counts do not offset required-family losses. No 5% floor or historical-tail-only veto was applied."
  },
